abstract: >-
  Course project for 05177012 Data Architecture & Data Engineering (KMITL K-DAI, semester 1/2569).
  An automated Bronze-Silver-Gold pipeline on Databricks with data-quality testing, a PK/FK model
  in PostgreSQL 17 (Lakebase), an AI/BI dashboard and an MLflow model for high-defect batches.
